00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:48.830
So I love going out there and it's like,

00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:52.480
except for your legislature
and the craziness you've got,

00:21:52.480 --> 00:21:54.210
you have so many problems.

00:21:54.210 --> 00:21:55.570
I don't even know how you exist.

00:21:55.570 --> 00:21:57.120
In fact, you're a good example of how

00:21:57.120 --> 00:22:00.810
resilient Capitalism is
despite having a bunch of,

00:22:00.810 --> 00:22:03.130
the best word is knuckleheads, socialists,

