government planners running your cities.

00:22:06.640 --> 00:22:08.560
And yet somehow,

00:22:08.560 --> 00:22:10.410
California still has so much going on

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:12.840
with the great climate for agriculture,

00:22:12.840 --> 00:22:15.240
the great coastline for tourism.

00:22:15.240 --> 00:22:17.160
So, we'll see but I think

00:22:18.120 --> 00:22:22.360
there's a chronic exodus
from New York, California.

00:22:22.360 --> 00:22:24.540
I'll give you an example
of what Rick Scott

00:22:24.540 --> 00:22:25.620
told us the other day.

00:22:25.620 --> 00:22:28.930
The former governor of
Florida now a senator.

00:22:28.930 --> 00:22:30.117
He said,

00:22:30.117 --> 00:22:33.597
"Florida has 3 million more
people than New York State,

00:22:33.597 --> 00:22:36.117
"but has one half the state budget.

00:22:36.117 --> 00:22:38.047
"This is another reason
not to send these people

00:22:38.047 --> 00:22:40.257
"more bailout money because
they'll just waste it

00:22:40.257 --> 00:22:42.420
"and we'll just reward bad behavior."

00:22:42.420 --> 00:22:44.090
They also will never open the economy

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:46.610
if we pass this Democratic latest one

00:22:46.610 --> 00:22:48.690
in addition to all the other bailouts,

00:22:48.690 --> 00:22:51.050
you think they're more or less
likely to open their economy

00:22:51.050 --> 00:22:52.080
if we give them money.

00:22:52.080 --> 00:22:54.720
Though only reason these
people will open their economy

00:22:54.720 --> 00:22:57.090
is when they run out of
other peoples' money.

00:22:57.090 --> 00:22:58.720
And so, that's coming.

00:22:58.720 --> 00:23:00.780
Their state treasuries are bare,

00:23:00.780 --> 00:23:02.640
and they're gonna have
to eventually open up

00:23:02.640 --> 00:23:04.080
even though they love controlling you

00:23:04.080 --> 00:23:04.913
and telling you what to do,

00:23:04.913 --> 00:23:06.570
they're gonna finally
become frightened when

00:23:06.570 --> 00:23:09.350
there's no money to even
pay their own salaries.

00:23:09.350 --> 00:23:11.170
- Yeah, all right Senator I
know you're crunched for time,

00:23:11.170 --> 00:23:13.260
so I just have one more for you.

00:23:13.260 --> 00:23:14.690
Can you just lay out sort of

00:23:14.690 --> 00:23:16.840
the broad sort of Libertarian approach

00:23:16.840 --> 00:23:19.240
when it comes to helping
people that need help most,

00:23:19.240 --> 00:23:21.410
and stimulus packages and everything else,

00:23:21.410 --> 00:23:24.140
this is where I see Libertarians
get hit all the time

00:23:24.140 --> 00:23:26.140
and don't necessarily have a good comeback

00:23:26.140 --> 00:23:28.360
when we see 30 million people unemployed

00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:31.180
and we don't have the money
to bail everything out,

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:33.180
yet we always do it and
get further into debt

00:23:33.180 --> 00:23:34.960
and you're basically the
only guy in the senate

00:23:34.960 --> 00:23:35.850
talking about it.

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:39.100
What is the proper, or better than proper,

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:41.820
what is the responsible
approach to helping people

00:23:41.820 --> 00:23:44.100
when we're telling them
that they can't work,

00:23:44.100 --> 00:23:46.600
yet also knowing that we
don't even have the money

00:23:46.600 --> 00:23:48.840
in the first place? (claps hand)

00:23:48.840 --> 00:23:49.673
- I think the most

00:23:49.673 --> 00:23:52.230
humanitarian economic
system is capitalism.

00:23:52.230 --> 00:23:54.670
It creates enormous amounts of wealth,

00:23:54.670 --> 00:23:57.170
and that's how you can help
those who can't help themselves,

00:23:57.170 --> 00:24:00.330
is by having great and enormous
amounts of wealth created.

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:01.540
Socialism doesn't work.

00:24:01.540 --> 00:24:04.423
I mean, if you think you're
gonna be a humanitarian,

00:24:05.920 --> 00:24:07.030
elect Chavez.

00:24:07.030 --> 00:24:08.790
Oh, that's right, you
already have in California.

00:24:08.790 --> 00:24:09.761
But, I mean,
(Dave laughs)

00:24:09.761 --> 00:24:11.120
We thing, we really think
- Yeah.

00:24:11.120 --> 00:24:11.953
Don't rub it in.

00:24:14.040 --> 00:24:15.260
- It's not gonna work.

00:24:15.260 --> 00:24:16.300
Socialism doesn't work.

00:24:16.300 --> 00:24:17.940
Capitalism is humanitarian.

00:24:17.940 --> 00:24:20.470
And then the only other
thing to remember is that,

00:24:20.470 --> 00:24:23.140
don't let people guilt you into anything.

00:24:23.140 --> 00:24:25.530
Look, I feel an obligation
to my fellow man,

00:24:25.530 --> 00:24:26.400
and most people do.

00:24:26.400 --> 00:24:27.750
I feel an obligation.

00:24:27.750 --> 00:24:29.420
I wanna live in a community

00:24:29.420 --> 00:24:31.520
where there are not people in the streets,

00:24:31.520 --> 00:24:33.030
hungry and begging.

00:24:33.030 --> 00:24:35.120
I want people to be taken care of.

00:24:35.120 --> 00:24:37.460
My wife and I participate in
several different charities

00:24:37.460 --> 00:24:38.510
in our community.

00:24:38.510 --> 00:24:40.310
We try to help raise money for them,

00:24:40.310 --> 00:24:43.130
and we want there to be a place
where people with addiction,

00:24:43.130 --> 00:24:45.740
for people getting out of prison
and trying to get a skill,

00:24:45.740 --> 00:24:46.840
all those things are,

00:24:46.840 --> 00:24:48.630
we actually want them for a selfish reason

00:24:48.630 --> 00:24:50.480
cause we wanna live in a community.

00:24:50.480 --> 00:24:53.310
John Allison is good at
describing this and saying,

00:24:53.310 --> 00:24:56.680
he's been because he wants
to live in a community

00:24:56.680 --> 00:24:58.410
where there aren't poor people everywhere

00:24:58.410 --> 00:25:00.510
that are begging and on the streets.

00:25:00.510 --> 00:25:01.790
He wants a community where

00:25:01.790 --> 00:25:03.980
there is charity that takes care of them,

00:25:03.980 --> 00:25:05.633
and we shouldn't be embarrassed to that,

00:25:05.633 --> 00:25:07.900
that there's a selfish
reason to give charity.

00:25:07.900 --> 00:25:10.370
Sort if an I'm radian sort of,

00:25:10.370 --> 00:25:13.300
self interest in altruism actually.

00:25:13.300 --> 00:25:14.960
But the other thing is that

00:25:14.960 --> 00:25:16.020
we should remember that

00:25:16.020 --> 00:25:19.050
there's a difference between
an obligation and a right.

00:25:19.050 --> 00:25:21.090
So I have an obligation
to help my fellow man

00:25:21.090 --> 00:25:24.780
because of my religious and moral beliefs.

00:25:24.780 --> 00:25:27.160
But you don't have a
right to a penny from me.

00:25:27.160 --> 00:25:28.230
And,

00:25:28.230 --> 00:25:30.827
