have a right to conscript me

00:25:30.827 --> 00:25:33.800
and make me give my services to somebody

00:25:33.800 --> 00:25:34.633
who doesn't

00:25:34.633 --> 00:25:35.466
have any money.

00:25:35.466 --> 00:25:38.080
As a physician I do give my services.

00:25:38.080 --> 00:25:39.560
But we just can't,

00:25:39.560 --> 00:25:41.060
once we give in and say,

00:25:41.060 --> 00:25:42.680
oh they have a right to our services,

00:25:42.680 --> 00:25:44.940
