00:25:54.330 --> 00:25:55.190
We gotta keep fighting.

00:25:55.190 --> 00:25:56.740
Even though we don't always win.

00:25:56.740 --> 00:25:58.940
I think there's a much
broader audience out there

00:25:58.940 --> 00:26:00.060
