00:26:00.060 --> 00:26:01.440
We just gotta replace a few people.

00:26:01.440 --> 00:26:03.330
If you'll help me replace a few people,

00:26:03.330 --> 00:26:04.443
it'll be a lot better.

00:26:05.460 --> 00:26:06.293
- I'm with you man.

00:26:06.293 --> 00:26:07.126
Well, I really appreciate it.

